Third-party comparison models
=============================

This repository includes thin adapters for publicly released segmentation
networks used as paper baselines. Those upstream codebases are not vendored
here. Obtain them from their original authors and respect their licenses:

- TransBTS
- NestedFormer
- Slim UNETR
- SegMamba / SegMamba-V2
- nnMamba
- U-Mamba
- VT-UNet
- nnFormer (standalone reimplementation used for comparison)
- nnU-Net / SwinUNETR / MONAI components used by optional extras

BraTS data must be requested from the challenge organizers and is not
included in this repository.
